## How do I join?

Students enrolled at Mounds View High School, and home-schooled high school students in the catchment area are eligible to join FRC Team 3407. Prospective members can find us at the activity fair on the first day of school at Mounds View, and if interested in joining the team, should attend our open houses which run through mid-to-late September. We STRONGLY recommend attending at least one of these open houses and to see if our team is a good fit before registering officially. Prospective members also have the opportunity to attend some of our preliminary meetings before the registration window ends, which is also strongly recommended, as much of the training and onboarding process happens in those meetings.

A guide to the registration process can be found here: [Registration Process]({% link registerguide.md %})

The registration process should be started late in September, and completed before the end of October.

